rprised → immediately changes to a happy expression. Woman takes a sip of the canned coffee → A truly delicious-looking, natural, and cute smile → Narrowing eyes slightly in a happy reaction. Combine slow motion and normal speed to emphasize the sense of happiness. Light is golden, soft, and beautiful. ④ (13-15s) Canned coffee floats in the air and rotates slowly (high-end product shot). Controlled so the front label of the can always faces the camera. Beautiful reflections, lighting, and highlights. Background is a slightly blurred Italian cityscape. ■Narration (Young woman''s voice, bright and light): ''Once you open it, you''re in Italy♪ Via Espresso.'' ■Additional Specifications: - Prioritize live-action quality (exclude CG feel). - Skin, light, shadows, and reflections are all real. - Camera work is smooth and cinematic. - Use depth of field appropriately. - Colors are warm to evoke appetite and happiness. - Overall visual expression that ''conveys the scent.''','missing',4,'A young woman wakes up in her small Tokyo apartment, opens a canned coffee, and the room magically transforms into a lively Italian street cafe as she takes a happy sip, ending with the can presented in a glamorous product shot.','keep','pass','direct','standard','food-cm','photoreal','live-action quality, natural colors, movie-like lighting','golden-hour','mixed','none',0.9,'Grounded canned-coffee ad with fantastical transformation into an Italian bar made entirely of the product''s cafe theme; food/beverage is the clear subject, genre-honest commercial joy, no fake-real deception.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=exclu