rgy. Without interruption, the world morphs again into a teenage bedroom lit by colorful LEDs and sunset light. Loud music thumps through speakers. Posters cover the walls. The teenager jumps recklessly on the bed laughing with friends, dancing, shouting, throwing pillows, overwhelming youthful energy everywhere. The bedroom walls slide away into a busy college campus walkway. The young adult rushes through crowds carrying books and coffee, stressed but alive, checking their phone while hurrying between classes. Fast-moving students cross frame. Bikes pass. Papers fly in the wind. The camera keeps moving right as the campus transforms into a crowded downtown city street during golden hour. Now dressed professionally, the adult pushes through crowds carrying a briefcase, overwhelmed but determined. Cars honk, trains rumble, traffic lights flicker, towering buildings reflect sunlight. The pace is intense and purposeful. The city lights dissolve into a beautiful outdoor wedding celebration. Warm sunset lighting. The adult spins their partner joyfully while confetti explodes into the air. Family and friends cheer loudly around them. Emotionally overwhelming happiness. Cinematic lens flares. Slow-motion feeling while camera still glides steadily right. The wedding scene seamlessly transforms into a vibrant public park filled with young children running chaotically around them. Parenthood phase. The couple laughs while trying to keep up with their energetic kids. Soccer balls roll past, dogs bark, bubbles float through warm afternoon sunlight. Beautiful family chaos. The environment slowly calms into a quiet warm home interior. Time has passed. The person is now older, wearing reading glasses in soft amber lighting, sitting peacefully with books and photographs nearby. The movement slows noticeably. Calmness replaces chaos. The home gently fades into a serene late-life scene. The elderly figure now walks slowly with a cane through soft golden evening light. White hair, wrinkles, gentle smile. Grandchildren happily tug at their hands while laughing softly. The camera movement becomes slower and more delicate. Finally, the elderly person sits quietly beside a large window bathed in warm golden sunset light. Dust particles float in the air. The outside world becomes soft and distant. Sound fades gradually into near silence. The figure closes their eyes peacefully as the camera continues drifting slightly right before slowly fading to black. Sound design evolves continuously throughout the sequence: hospital monitor beeps → kindergarten screams and laughter → playground chaos → loud teenage music → busy campus chatter → aggressive city traffic → wedding cheers → children laughing in the park → quiet home ambience → birds chirping softly → near silence. Ultra photorealistic IMAX cinematic quality, emotionally overwhelming storytelling, seamless environmental morphing transitions, natural motion blur, volumetric lighting, dynamic depth of field, vivid colors during youth gradually softening with age, masterful cinematography, highly detailed facial animation, realistic human motion, deeply emotional visual pacing, one continuous tracking shot with absolutely no cuts.','missing',9,'A single flowing journey follows one person from birth through childhood, school, youth, love, and old age as the world seamlessly transforms around them, ending in a peaceful moment bathed in golden light.','keep','pass','aspirational','high','craft-piece','photoreal','IMAX-style, natural motion blur, volumetric lighting, dynamic depth of field','mixed','24fps-cinematic','none',0.85,'Grounded, brand-safe life-journey one-shot; no hospitality tie needed—qualifies via wide aspirational route on craft/emotional storytelling; authentic, not staged.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url