re ecosystem built around one organism. The camera rises with the tree as it reaches for the canopy. [11s–13s] The tree breaks through the canopy ceiling. Sunlight. The camera emerges from the green into open sky. For the first time, the scale of the forest is visible — an unbroken ocean of green stretching to every horizon. Rivers thread through it like silver veins. Clouds build. The tree is one cell in a body the size of a continent. [13s–15s] The camera keeps rising. The Amazon basin curves with the Earth. The planet''s edge appears. Blue atmosphere against black space. The forest is a green lung on a blue world. One seed. One tree. One forest. One planet. The same thing at every scale. Cut to black. Impossible continuous shot: canopy → soil → inside seed → germination time-lapse → tree growth → canopy emergence → continental aerial → orbital perspective. Lighting transitions from dappled green forest to dark underground to cellular bioluminescence to','missing',7,'An unbroken journey follows a single seed from the Amazon canopy into the soil, through germination, growth into a towering tree and its ecosystem, and out past the forest''s edge to the curve of the Earth itself.','keep','pass','aspirational','high','mood-piece','photoreal','impossible continuous single-take camera move, macro-to-orbital scale transitions','mixed','mixed','none',0.85,'Grounded real-world Amazon rainforest, no fantasy/violence; cinematic scale-journey concept qualifies as aspirational craft piece, not staged/fake.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, d