As it exits the bridge, the camera smoothly pans right and decelerates, seamlessly transitioning into a medium portrait shot of a young man sitting on the granite river embankment. The man has short textured hair with subtle highlights, light stubble, and sharp facial features. He is wearing a relaxed white button-down shirt, dark blue denim jeans, clean white sneakers, and a minimal silver chain bracelet.
He initially looks away toward the horizon, then slowly turns his gaze toward the camera with a calm, confident expression. The background features the open drawbridge against a soft, pastel twilight sky, with reflections shimmering on the water. Cinematic, hyper-realistic, continuous single-take, 8K resolution, photorealistic, smooth motion, natural lighting, ultra-detailed textures.','missing',6,'A single sweeping descent falls from space into St. Petersburg, past St. Isaac''s golden dome and through the raised Palace Bridge, then eases into a portrait of a young man on the granite embankment at twilight.','keep','pass','aspirational','standard','destination-showcase','photoreal','8K','mixed','24fps-cinematic','none',0.85,'Grounded, real destination hyper-lapse into cinematic portrait; no hospitality subject but strong aspirational/destination craft.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
