Scene Style: Premium dessert commercial with a soft light grey to charcoal gradient background. Subtle studio shadows, glossy reflections, and high-end lighting setup. Luxurious, minimal aesthetic.
Opening Shot (0–3s):
Slow fade-in from black. A sleek glass dessert cup appears in center frame. Soft spotlight reveals a perfectly swirled scoop of rich dark chocolate ice cream. Camera slowly pushes in (macro lens feel).
Middle Shot (3–10s):
The molten chocolate core begins to slowly ooze from the center. Thick, glossy lava-like chocolate drips down in slow motion. Add hyper-detailed texture: creamy surface, melting edges, smooth highlights.
Floating elements (slow-motion, weightless): dark chocolate chunks, soft brownie bites, and silky chocolate sauce ribbons orbit around the scoop. Subtle rotation of the product.
Detail Shot (10–13s):
Extreme close-up of dripping chocolate. Emphasize viscosity, shine, and indulgence. Light glints on the flowing chocolate. Micro droplets and stretch effect for realism.
Final Shot (13–15s):
Camera pulls back slightly. All elements settle. Clean hero shot of the dessert centered. Optional text fade-in: “Pure Chocolate Indulgence”. Soft glow highlight.
Motion & Effects:
Slow-motion liquid physics
Smooth cinematic camera movements (push-in, slight orbit)
Depth of field (sharp product, blurred background)
Subtle particles/dust for premium feel
Lighting:
Soft studio key light + rim light for gloss and depth. High contrast reflections on chocolate.
Mood:
Luxurious, indulgent, rich, satisfying.','missing',4,'A luxurious dessert commercial lingers over a swirl of dark chocolate ice cream as its molten center slowly spills out, closing on a clean, elegant hero shot of the finished treat.','keep','pass','direct','standard','food-cm','photoreal','macro lens feel, depth of field, sharp product with blurred background','mixed','high-fps-slowmo','none',0.97,'Premium dessert product commercial, grounded and direct food-cm home; genre-honest execution.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
