[Style]
Nostalgic Japanese home anime. Evening kitchen. Outside the window is slightly blue, while the interior has warm yellow lighting. Wooden cutting board, white plates, domestic kitchen knife, small frying pan, old kitchen. Background is hand-drawn watercolor style, hands and ingredients are in cel-shaded style. Simple two-tone shading. Soft lighting. Carefully depict steam, knife movements, egg texture, breadcrumbs, tomato cross-sections, etc. Generally quiet, a bit nostalgic, and feels lived-in.

[Scenes]
Instead of showing a single dish being completed, capture handiwork within meal preparation as five independent scenes. Show different ingredients and actions to create a slice-of-life hand animation.

[scene1]
Shot from directly above the cutting board. Only the hands are shown, slowly cutting a red tomato with a knife. Each time the blade enters, the flesh and seeds are visible, revealing a juicy cross-section. The sliced tomatoes are lined up bit by bit on the cutting board.

[scene2]
Close-up from a slight angle. Hold an egg with one hand, tap it lightly against the rim of a bowl, then crack it with both hands. The shell opens, and the yolk and white drop out. Carefully depict the stringy texture of the egg and the movement inside the bowl.

[scene3]
Hand shot from a diagonal front. Slowly slicing bread with a knife. The soft bread sinks slightly, and fine air bubbles are visible on the cut surface. Breadcrumbs fall slightly onto the wooden cutting board.

[scene4]
Close-range shot next to the stove. Beaten eggs are poured into a frying pan and gently mixed with cooking chopsticks. The soft-boiled parts and cooked parts slowly change shape. Steam rises, and warm light hits the edge of the pan.

[scene5]
Fixed shot near the table. Only the hands are shown, quietly arranging the cut tomatoes, egg dish, and sliced bread onto a plate. Finally, a cup is gently placed, and steam rises. Does not show the completion of the meal in an exaggerated way, but ends with a quiet lingering sense of preparation being complete.','missing',5,'Told entirely through close-up hand movements, this gentle, nostalgic film follows the quiet steps of preparing a simple home meal — slicing tomatoes, cracking eggs, cutting bread, and cooking — ending with the plate quietly set and ready.','keep','pass','direct','standard','craft-piece','stylized-real','cel-shaded 1990s-2000s anime texture, hand-drawn backgrounds, soft outlines, film grain, slight color bleeding','warm-amber','24fps-cinematic','none',0.9,'Grounded, brand-safe, food-prep home; nostalgic anime craft piece, authentic slice-of-life execution.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
