sushi lift\n• Low angle on torch flame shot\n• Hero close-up on final sushi piece reveal\nStyle:\n• Warm elegant sushi bar lighting throughout\n• Soft orange torch glow on flame shots\n• Pixar CGI vivid expressive animation\n• Rich food textures — glossy salmon, fluffy rice, crisp nori, fresh avocado\n• Smooth satisfying cuts, calm masterful energy throughout\nGoal: A mouth-watering 12-second sushi journey from fresh rice to perfect sushi reveal — precise, elegant, and impossible to scroll past.','missing',8,'A precise, elegant journey through handmade sushi — from fluffed rice and glossy salmon to a torched flame flourish and a final, irresistible chopstick-lifted reveal.','keep','pass','direct','standard','food-cm','3d-animation','Pixar CGI vivid expressive animation, rich food textures','warm-amber','24fps-cinematic','none',0.95,'Grounded Pixar-style food-making sequence in real sushi bar, direct hospitality/food subject, genuine craft-driven food commercial energy.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
