 grandeur and energy. CUT 1 (0–4s): Wide aerial establishing shot — the full courtyard from above, the white horse at the far end beginning its procession down the torch-lit path, fireworks exploding overhead painting the sky in gold and crimson, hundreds of guests visible on both sides. CUT 2 (4–8s): Ground-level medium tracking shot — camera moves alongside the horse at eye level, capturing the groom''s proud posture, the horse''s decorated chest and bobbing floral mane, marigold garlands swaying, guests cheering and throwing flower petals into the path ahead, fireworks bursting directly overhead. CUT 3 (8–12s): Low dramatic angle from directly in front — camera at ground level looking up at the horse and groom advancing toward the lens, massive firework explosion erupting behind and above them, silhouetting the groom in a halo of gold and white light, torches blazing on either side like a corridor of fire. CUT 4 (12–15s): Slow-motion extreme close-up medley — the horse''s hooves stepping on petal-strewn marble in slow motion → groom''s hand adjusting the reins, gold embroidery catching firelight → groom''s eyes behind the sehra, warm and emotional → final wide pull-back as the grandest firework of all explodes across the entire sky, flooding the scene in pure golden light. Style: Cinematic Bollywood grandeur meets Natio','missing',4,'A groom on a flower-adorned white horse processes through a torch-lit palatial courtyard lined with cheering wedding guests as fireworks explode overhead, ending in a golden, emotional close on the couple''s ceremonial approach.','keep','pass','direct','high','destination-showcase','photoreal','cinematic Bollywood grandeur','golden-hour','mixed','none',0.88,'Grounded, real-world palatial Indian wedding venue procession; authentic cultural ceremony, no fantasy or fakery; strong cinematic craft.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
