nding TikTok food vlog sound / chill lo-fi beat Strong ASMR layer: bite crunch, sauce drip, cheese stretch Subtle bass hit exactly at first cheese pull (hook moment) Audio clarity improves after 5 seconds (matches video quality jump)','missing',5,'A food influencer''s phone-style burger review escalates from an eye-catching cheese-pull close-up to an unfiltered, delighted first bite, ending on a confident thumbs-up and a glossy hero shot of the burger.','keep','pass','direct','standard','food-cm','photoreal','UGC handheld phone camera feel transitioning to crisp 4K HDR, shallow depth of field, natural motion blur','warm-amber','mixed','none',0.93,'UGC-style food ad, genre-honest enthusiasm, grounded and brand-safe, direct food home.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
