The sequence should begin with the airplane in stable forward motion under natural lighting, maintaining realistic scale, perspective, and aerodynamics.
During the transformation, the airplane must reconfigure through visible mechanical movement: wings retract and fold inward, engines compress and merge into a central propulsion system, and the fuselage reshapes into a sleek cylindrical rocket body. Panels should slide, rotate, and lock into place with clear mechanical articulation, including subtle sparks, heat glow, and internal structural detail. Avoid smooth morphing — the transformation must feel engineered and physically plausible.
Once the rocket form is complete, the engine ignites with an intense, bright exhaust plume featuring a white-hot core and glowing edges. Add strong heat distortion and air turbulence behind the thrust.
The rocket then sharply pitches upward and accelerates rapidly toward the upper atmosphere, leaving a long, powerful exhaust trail. Motion should follow realistic physics with increasing speed, visible acceleration, and dynamic motion blur.
The sky should subtly transition from lower atmosphere tones to deeper blue as altitude increases.
Maintain a single continuous shot with consistent perspective, cinematic lighting, high contrast, and realistic textures. Avoid visual artifacts, distortion, or abrupt cuts. The overall feel should be high-energy, cinematic, and physically grounded.','missing',6,'In one continuous shot an airplane in steady flight reconfigures mechanically into a sleek rocket, ignites a brilliant exhaust plume and climbs sharply toward the upper atmosphere as the sky deepens to blue.','keep','pass','aspirational','standard','craft-piece','photoreal','single continuous shot; motion blur; high contrast',NULL,'24fps-cinematic','none',0.72,'Grounded, brand-safe, no fantasy; no hospitality subject but qualifies via aspirational cinematic/kinetic craft route; authentic engineering spectacle, not staged-real.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
