Core Concept
Congested ground (current dilemma) -> Mechanical transformation (technological highlight) -> Vertical takeoff (freedom and future).

Style Setting
High-end Car Commercial quality. Cyberpunk future city, cold rainy night, neon light and shadow. 8K ultra-clear, Transformer-level mechanical details, extreme speed streamline feeling.

Scene Breakdown
Shot 1: Ground Dilemma
Frame: Close-up. A highly streamlined silver supercar “Y” is stationary on a congested, neon-lit rainy night street. Rain slides over its smooth paint, reflecting red taillights.
Details: The minimalist “Y” glowing Logo on the front flickers slightly like a breathing light. Surrounded by noisy horns, the protagonist (the car) appears calm and elegant.
Shot 2: Mechanical Awakening
Frame: Extreme Macro close-up.
Action: Driving mode switch. Precise mechanical meshing sounds come from inside the wheels, the tires flip down 90 degrees, and internal thrusters are revealed.
Special Effects: Ethereal blue plasma thrusters ignite instantly, evaporating the rainwater on the road into white mist. The car body smoothly hovers vertically amidst the onlookers'' gasps.
Shot 3: Soaring Future
Frame: Wide-angle follow shot.
Action: Instant acceleration from a standstill. The car “Y” transforms into a silver lightning bolt, pulling up vertically, speeding through skyscrapers, leaving the red traffic below.
Ending Freeze Frame: The car body flies towards a giant full moon, and a silver metallic 3D Logo appears in the center of the frame: “Y - Drive the Future”.','missing',3,'A stalled supercar waits out gridlocked night traffic, then transforms before onlookers'' eyes and launches skyward, streaking between skyscrapers toward a full moon as the brand mark appears.','keep','pass','aspirational','high','flagship-ad','stylized-real','High-end car commercial quality, ultra-clear detail, transformer-level mechanical detailing, extreme speed streamline feeling','cold-blue','mixed','none',0.83,'Near-future flying-car transformation is grounded sci-tech, not off-world fantasy; premium car-commercial craft with genre-honest tone gives it aspirational appeal despite no explicit hospitality tie.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
