• Subject: A figure in a dark suit rides a horse galloping out of the mansion gate
• Horse Action: White horse''s four hooves airborne, mane flying, charging out at a fast pace or trot
• Environment: Winter, light snow kicked up by the horse''s hooves, mansion architecture clearly visible (large floor-to-ceiling windows, wood and stone combination, multi-story terraces), outlines of the North Shore mountains or ocean faintly visible in the distance, evergreen pine trees covered with light snow
• Crowd: Supporters on both sides dodge and make way while waving yellow dragon flags (blue dragon pattern + Hinomaru elements) and cheering, holding white “Nothing” signs
• Camera: Frontal shot, white horse charging directly at the camera, strong sense of motion (slight low angle to enhance impact)
• Atmosphere: Sharp entrance, unstoppable momentum, stunning debut in a high-end private community

Scene 2: Crowd Chasing Close-up (0:05-0:09, 4 seconds)
• Location: Next to the tree-lined private winding road in the mansion area
• Subject: Group of supporters running after the horse (mainly young people, wearing winter down jackets/coats)
• Action: Running while raising hands, shouting, and pumping fists, trying to keep up with the horse''s speed, some almost falling but still chasing excitedly
• Signs: Yellow dragon flags + white “Nothing” signs are carried while running (signs shaking)
• Background: Mansion exterior walls and evergreen pine trees quickly passing by, light snow mist or tree shadows blurring and shaking, distant mountains passing by
• Camera: Follow-up close-up, slight camera shake to create urgency and speed (handheld style or quick push/pull)
• Atmosphere: Frenzied pursuit, urgent excitement, enthusiastic response from community residents
Scene 3: Galloping Across the Side of the Mansion (0:09-0:15, 6 seconds)
• Location: Side landscape driveway or extended lawn area of the mansion (side view shows large terrace, poolside or garden, evergreen hedges)
• Subject: The figure rides the white horse galloping across the frame
• Horse Action: Full speed running, the moment the four hooves leave the ground is clearly visible, the horse''s tail flutters like a flag, snow is splashed up
• Environment: The side of the mansion quickly passes by (wood and stone walls, multi-story windows blurred), adjacent mansion and evergreen forest on the left, mountain and sea skyline in the background passing by
• Crowd: Supporters behind holding “Nothing” signs + yellow dragon flags chase but gradually fall behind, some stop and wave and shout
• Camera: High-speed side follow shot, motion blur enhances the sense of speed (horse sweeps across the frame, background blurred)
• Atmosphere: Lightning speed, unstoppable, heroic gallop in a luxurious community','missing',3,'A rider gallops a white horse out of a grand winter estate as a crowd of supporters waving flags and signs chases along the drive, cheering the dramatic entrance through falling snow.','keep','pass','aspirational','high','flagship-ad','photoreal','','cold-blue','24fps-cinematic','flagged-for-review',0.78,'Grounded real-world luxury estate scene, cinematic premium execution qualifies as aspirational; ''Nothing'' brand signage flags for IP review; no fake staging, genre-honest ad energy.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
