Final Scene – Eid Mubarak
Golden crescent moon appears above the dunes with elegant glowing Arabic calligraphy. Text fades in: “Eid Mubarak”.','missing',9,'A family greets Eid in the desert: waking at dawn in their tent, dressing in traditional finery, walking beside camels across the dunes, laying out a feast, gathering with neighbors under lanterns, walking to prayer, and celebrating late into the night with fireworks under a crescent moon.','keep','pass','both','high','cultural-moment','photoreal','ultra realistic, soft film grain, 4K','golden-hour','24fps-cinematic','none',0.93,'Grounded, brand-safe, culturally warm Eid celebration with food, hospitality, and community—direct and aspirational home; authentic festive tone throughout.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
