11–15s: Cinematic side profile shot as she walks down the aisle. Soft sunlight beams through store windows, creating a dreamy glow. Camera slowly pulls back as she continues shopping calmly.

Mood: Peaceful, everyday lifestyle elegance, slightly cinematic commercial feel.

Visual Quality: Ultra-realistic, 4K detail, smooth motion, natural skin tones, shallow focus, soft bokeh background.','missing',4,'A young woman moves peacefully through a sunlit modern grocery store, carefully picking fresh produce as she works through her shopping list.','keep','pass','direct','low','light-social','photoreal','4K detail, shallow depth of field, soft bokeh','warm-amber','mixed','none',0.9,'Grounded, brand-safe everyday grocery shopping scene; direct food/lifestyle home; genuine commercial mood; generic but valid.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
