Action: Frame freezes + slight film grain effect fades out.','missing',8,'In a moonlit Wuxia courtyard, a caped cat hero interrogates a scholar duck tied to a stake over a hidden capsule, until a self-assured husky doctor bursts in with an absurdly simple solution, leaving everyone stunned.','keep','pass','aspirational','standard','meme-comedy','3d-animation','','warm-amber','24fps-cinematic','none',0.78,'Animals in human roles (wuxia cat, scholar duck, doctor husky) doing honest absurd comedy; grounded real-world courtyard setting with cinematic wuxia craft; no hospitality subject but qualifies via wide aspirational route on craft/charm; genre-honest comedy passes authenticity.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
