Warm milk and butter poured in — folded until smooth vivid green batter.
Batter poured onto flat baking sheet lined with parchment — spread evenly thin with spatula.
Sheet placed in oven — warm glow, timer set.
Sponge removed — thin green sheet, springy surface. Placed on clean parchment, rolled loosely while warm — sets the shape. Unrolled gently.
Strawberries sliced on board — thin even pieces.
Heavy cream whipped in bowl — pink food coloring added, whipped to stiff peaks, pink cream formed.
Pink cream spread generously across entire green sponge surface — spatula smooth strokes.
Strawberry slices laid in even row across cream.
Sponge rolled tightly from one end — both hands roll firmly and evenly, parchment guides the roll.
Rolled cake wrapped in parchment, refrigerated — hands press ends flat.
Roll unwrapped — placed on white plate. Pink mirror glaze poured over top — glossy pink coat drips down sides.
Green grapes placed on top center.
Watermelon slice wedge placed beside grapes. Pearl beads placed around base. Hands lift plate toward window — sunlight catches glaze.
Sounds only: whisk, batter spread, oven hum, cream whipping, rolling, glaze pour. 15 seconds. Gentle flowing pacing.','missing',6,'In a cozy, sunlit anime-style kitchen, a matcha roll cake comes together step by step, from whisked batter to a rolled sponge filled with strawberry cream, finished with a glossy pink glaze and delicate garnishes.','keep','pass','direct','standard','food-cm','2.5d-hybrid','','warm-amber','24fps-cinematic','none',0.9,'Grounded cozy food-prep sequence, matcha roll cake, direct food home, genuine craft process, no fakery.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
