• Camera: From close-up (sandwich bite detail) → Slowly pulls back to an extreme long shot, low-angle perspective, emphasizing the “don''t care” sense of isolated heroism; finally fades out
• Atmosphere: Self-mocking yet dashing, heroic and unrestrained, symbolic ending (“Nothing” can still move forward)','missing',4,'A confident rider gallops toward an adoring crowd waving flags, only for them to rush past him straight into a beloved bun shop, leaving him to shrug it off and ride on with a sandwich in hand.','keep','pass','both','high','meme-comedy','photoreal','frontal follow shot switching to POV, quick pan/wide-angle, close-up pulling back to extreme long shot','mixed','24fps-cinematic','none',0.78,'Grounded comedic scene with real food home (steamed bun shop); crowd bypasses rider for buns - absurdist but honest comedy, not staged-fake; likely political meme reference (''Nothing''/dragon flags) but no explicit real-person IP named.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
