arms raised for a high-five. The main character tilts her head, gently adjusts the brim of the frozen woman’s Yankees cap, nods slightly, and softly says: “perfect.” [0:11–0:15] She turns, tosses the popcorn kernel into her mouth, and crunches it. She faces the camera, smirks, and snaps again. A stronger reverse shockwave restores motion. The beer completes its splash, the cheering roar instantly returns, and fans land their jumps. She walks away as the camera pushes through the wildly celebrating crowd. Fade to black. Sound: deafening bar roar/celebration → snap → deep shockwave/bass drop → absolute silence → footsteps → sharp popcorn crunch → “perfect” → snap → reverse shockwave → deafening celebration returns','missing',5,'In the middle of a championship-night bar celebration, a woman snaps her fingers and freezes the entire room mid-cheer, strolling calmly through suspended beer and popcorn before snapping again to let the party roar back to life.','keep','pass','direct','high','craft-piece','photoreal','Arri Alexa Mini, 35mm lens, shallow depth of field, volumetric haze, dynamic hard shadows','mixed','mixed','flagged-for-review',0.85,'Real sports-bar venue, time-freeze is a stylized power not off-world; lands directly in hospitality setting; Yankees/MLB real-brand reference flagged for review.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip