but he triumphantly walks straight into the perfectly clean fixed glass side panel next to it, not the open doorway.
Soft comedic impact, no injury, just stunned silence.
He slowly slides one hand onto the glass with broken dignity.acter identity and exact store layout for all 10 seconds.','missing',5,'A delivery courier gets repeatedly outsmarted by a store''s automatic door, which only opens when he''s not looking, building to a good-natured collision with the fixed glass panel beside it.','keep','pass','both','standard','meme-comedy','3d-animation','','golden-hour','24fps-cinematic','none',0.88,'Grounded convenience-store setting, honest absurd physical comedy (door gag), courier/retail environment gives direct home; passes authenticity as knowing slapstick, not fake-real.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
