Voiceover (VO) weight is high: Add a low-voiced, restrained Chinese documentary narration (not commercial tone), using short sentences to describe "cooking heat, steam, reunion, and time," without mentioning brands, film titles, or specific place names.','missing',8,'A documentary-style look at a Northern Chinese family''s New Year''s Eve feast, moving through sizzling woks, a steamed whole fish drizzled with red oil, crisp stir-fried greens, and boiling dumplings, ending with the full spread laid out together for the family reunion meal.','keep','pass','direct','high','food-cm','photoreal','24fps, fine grain, shallow depth of field','warm-amber','24fps-cinematic','none',0.97,'Grounded, brand-safe food documentary; direct home via family dinner cuisine; authentic craft, no contrivance.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
