s and pans. An explosion of kitchenware. A colander lands on the dog''s head like a helmet. He sits in the wreckage, tail still wagging. [13s–15s] The cat drops the fish skeleton on the dog''s head, pulls down his ski mask, and moonwalks across the counter toward the window. He turns back, salutes, and disappears into the night. Cut to black. 3D animated, Pixar quality fur and lighting, kitchen heist, cat vs dog comedy, moonlit slapstick, cinematic, 4K.','missing',8,'A sly tabby cat in a tiny disguise stages an elaborate late-night raid on an unattended salmon fillet, narrowly evading a bumbling dog before slipping away into the night with his prize.','keep','pass','direct','standard','meme-comedy','3d-animation','',NULL,'24fps-cinematic','none',0.9,'Animal comedy heist centered on food (salmon) in a kitchen; honest absurd comedy, grounded, brand-safe, direct food home.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
