adcast + magazine quality, sharp subject detail, realistic fabric physics, skin texture, motion blur only where needed, crowd depth layering. Constraints: strictly photorealistic, no anime/cartoon, consistent identity across panels, athletic tasteful depiction, focus on gymnastics performance storytelling. Hyper-realistic cinematic 15s continuous shot of a Japanese Olympic female gymnast (chubby athletic build) performing a full floor routine in a packed Olympic arena. Strict 16-beat storyboard progression: entrance walk → still focus → opening pose → choreographed chassé → split leap → back handspring → tumbling entry → back tuck → stuck landing → expressive dance → floor split → pirouette spin → final tumbling pass → final landing → closing pose → bow & salute with standing ovation. Photorealistic Olympic broadcast style, 60fps, seamless motion continuity, no cuts, smooth transitions, warm white stadium spotlights + cool blue fill, leotard sparkle highlights, realistic crowd depth, judges visible, arena flags and scoreboard in background, cinematic camera tracking, sports documentary realism.','missing',5,'A Japanese gymnast delivers a full floor routine in a packed arena, moving through her entrance, leaps and tumbling passes to a triumphant closing bow before a standing ovation.','keep','pass','aspirational','standard','craft-piece','photoreal','broadcast and magazine quality, realistic fabric physics, motion blur where needed','mixed','high-fps-slowmo','none',0.85,'Adult athlete, grounded real-world Olympic gymnastics; no hospitality tie but strong cinematic sports craft qualifies via wide aspirational route; authentic genre-honest sports documentary tone.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count