fies and suspends, the vibration pattern of the water film on the mossy stone surface is clearly visible. Immediately returns to high speed after 0.3 seconds, VHS screen shows frame rate jump noise at the moment of speed switch. Large-scale whip pan switches to a high-angle overhead shot, continuous jumping watermark tracks left on the mossy wet ground, the light afterimage forms a spiral flow pattern from the overhead perspective. Sound Effects: Extremely slow water sound of water droplets scattering at the slow-motion peak, sudden burst of impact sound when returning to high speed, the frequency of the waterfall roar changes abruptly with the speed switch. 8-12 seconds: High-energy zoom in/out · Multi-angle switching. High-energy camera zoom, first rapidly pulling back—the Mecha Warrior''s pink battle pants become the only warm-colored visual anchor against the green and white waterfall background—then rapidly pushing in to a close-up of the katana tip, faint blue particles continuously flowing at the tip, the mist refracting cold blue light in the blade light. Three consecutive rapid perspective switches: ① Low-angle upward shot—the katana slashes down from above the head, the blade and the waterfall curtain form a double white light collision in the same vertical frame ② Side tracking shot—the wide sleeves and the waterfall flow direction form horizontal and vertical intersecting force lines ③ High-angle overhead shot—the figure appears simultaneously with a double afterimage in the reflection on the mossy water surface Each switch is accompanied by a brief distortion of VHS horizontal scan line tearing, dense snowflake noise in the high-speed motion area. The light afterimages of the katana are superimposed three times, finally forming a faint blue light net covering the waterfall scene. Sound Effects: Multi-angle switching frame jump noise, dense metallic clang of continuous katana strikes, waterfall roar rapidly pushing in and pulling out with the perspective switch. 12-15 seconds: Airborne finishing pose · Sword energy diffusion · Grand panoramic view. The Mecha Warrior steps on the highest mossy giant rock, leaping airborne to the highest point, the cyan-green wide sleeves fully spread, the jade belt swinging out the maximum arc, the pink battle pants are most saturated in counter-light, white sneakers suspended above the waterfall mist. Holding the katana with both hands, performing a finishing move downwards— [Final Chapter Triple Burst] ① Moment the katana contacts the water surface: Faint blue sword energy diffuses outwards in concentric circular light waves, the light wave pushes the entire waterfall curtain outwards forming an arc-shaped water wall ② Light wave touches the mossy rock wall: Water droplets on the entire moss surface simultaneously take flight, dense water droplet curtain scatters outwards, refracting a cold blue spectrum in the dim light ③ Sword energy bursts upwards: A faint blue light column rushes towards the sky from the katana tip, penetrating the waterfall mist layer forming a blue and white light column, the mist heavily churning and scattering, ferns bent by the air wave [Final Chapter Slow Motion · 3 seconds throughout] The diffusion pattern of the light ripples on the mossy water surface, the refraction spectrum of the water droplet curtain in the blade light, the fabric texture flow of the wide sleeves in the air wave, the final freeze frame of the white sneakers stepping on the water splash, every detail is clear and shocking. The camera slowly pulls back, ending with a grand panoramic view—the full view of the multi-layered waterfall is presented again, the Mecha Warrior stands on the highest mossy giant rock, the faint blue light afterglow slowly dissipates in the mist, the pink battle pants are finally frozen against the green and white waterfall background. VHS four corners are completely crushed to black, film grain bursts into silver-white noise in the high-light area of the ligh