👑:
“…This isn''t food… it''s your heart.”
🎙️ VO:
“In a world bound by duty… even a king can feel.”
Ending: – Fire slowly calming
– Fade to black','missing',5,'In a misty Joseon palace kitchen, a young royal chef pours herself into perfecting a dish, unaware the king has quietly come to watch -- and when he finally tastes her cooking, his guarded heart softens.','keep','pass','direct','high','craft-piece','2.5d-hybrid','4K, film grain, volumetric lighting, cinematic depth of field','warm-amber','24fps-cinematic','none',0.9,'Grounded historical palace kitchen drama, food is central emotional payoff, adult characters, genre-honest romantic narrative craft.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
