Legs visible behind the broom, wearing short denim pants (shorts), bare thighs
Sneakers on feet
Slight visibility of short hair tips at top edge, moving in wind

Riding posture:
Leaning slightly forward (like riding a broom in a classic witch style)
Broom stick aligned between legs
Stable but dynamic posture

---

Framing (VERY IMPORTANT):
Vertical composition (9:16)
Hands and broom handle always remain in the lower 30% of the frame
Forward view dominates the upper 70% of the frame
No cutting away from POV

---

Scene setting:
Bright daytime, clear sky, vivid and saturated colors
Japanese sightseeing locations

---

Camera motion:
Fast forward movement
Natural up-down motion (broom floating effect)
Slight shaking from wind
Subtle tilting during turns

---

[0.0s - 1.2s | TAKE OFF]
Camera angled slightly downward
Both hands gripping broom visible
Feet lift off ground smoothly
Wind begins lightly

---

[1.2s - 3.0s | ACCELERATION]
Speed increases
Wind becomes stronger
Hands tighten grip slightly
Legs react subtly to airflow

---

[3.0s - 6.0s | SHIBUYA FLIGHT]
Fly low across Shibuya crossing
People below looking up (motion blurred)
Buildings passing quickly
Maintain stable forward POV

---

[6.0s - 8.5s | TEMPLE PASS]
Transition to Senso-ji area
Fly close to lanterns and gate
Slight slowdown for cinematic feel

---

[8.5s - 11.0s | TORII RUN]
Enter red torii gates pathway
Fly straight through multiple gates at high speed
Strong motion blur on sides

---

[11.0s - 13.0s | FINAL ASCENT]
Tilt upward slightly
Gain altitude
Sky fills upper frame
Hands still gripping broom visible

---

Effects:
Wind affecting hands, legs, and hair tips
Motion blur at edges
Depth of field: center sharp, sides slightly blurred

---

Lighting:
Bright natural sunlight, soft shadows, high contrast

---

Color grading:
Vivid, cinematic, slightly warm tone for travel appeal

---

Mood:
Exciting, free, magical, immersive travel experience
Sense of freedom and speed

---

Style:
Hyper-realistic POV, fantasy + tourism fusion, immersive experience','missing',6,'Riding a broom through the sky in first-person view, a young woman soars low over Shibuya crossing, glides past lantern-lit temple gates, and threads through a run of red torii gates before climbing skyward, a fantastical tour of Tokyo''s icons.','keep','pass','both','high','destination-showcase','photoreal','first-person POV, 4K, 24fps, motion blur, shallow depth of field','warm-amber','24fps-cinematic','none',0.78,'Fantasy broom-flight mechanism over entirely real, named Japanese tourism destinations (Shibuya, Senso-ji, torii gates) — impossible transportation in a grounded real-world setting, akin to physics-defying action anchor; no sexualization despite bare-thigh detail, adult subject, authentic destination-showcase execution.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
