e skirt of the wedding dress, the real scene and the reflection are like a world in a mirror, with a pure and dreamy blue and white color palette. Finally, the frame freezes, with the bride and groom embracing in the mirror of the sky, the reflection like a painting. Sound effects: Dreamy synthesizer sounds, minimalist piano, gentle wind sounds, soft female humming. Prohibited: Any text, subtitles, LOGO, or watermark.','missing',3,'A bride and groom stand hand in hand at the edge of a mirror-still salt lake where sky and water become one, embracing and sharing a tender forehead kiss as golden light wraps around them, their reflection completing the scene like a dream.','keep','pass','aspirational','high','destination-showcase','photoreal','4K high definition','cold-blue','24fps-cinematic','none',0.9,'Grounded, brand-safe destination wedding visual with genuine romantic craft; no hospitality subject but strong aspirational/cinematic execution at a real salt-lake mirror location.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
