warm ambient glow.

End on a polished cinematic hero shot of the completed home.

No inconsistencies between blueprint and final architecture.
Perfect continuity from start to finish.','missing',6,'A glowing luxury house blueprint transforms in one seamless aerial timelapse, walls and roof rising from the plan and materializing into a fully finished modern home at golden hour.','keep','pass','aspirational','standard','craft-piece','photoreal','hyperrealistic architectural visualization, photoreal materials','golden-hour','24fps-cinematic','none',0.82,'Grounded luxury real-estate architectural transformation; no hospitality subject but strong cinematic aspirational craft, real-world, brand-safe, authentic execution.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
