Scene sequence (timed for precise 14-second duration):
0–2s: Extreme high-angle aerial shot racing over a vast, endless emerald-green Amazonian jungle canopy under bright daylight. The drone bursts into frame from the top, flying directly toward camera at breakneck speed before diving sharply downward into the dense forest.
2–8s: Chaotic, high-speed first-person and close third-person chase through the thick jungle interior. The drone weaves aggressively between massive moss-covered tree trunks, hanging vines, and dense ferns at dizzying speed. Volumetric god rays pierce the misty air. Brightly colored macaws (vivid red, blue, and yellow) scatter and fly chaotically around it, some nearly colliding with the drone. Camera follows tightly with whip pans, Dutch angles, and rapid tilts to convey extreme velocity and danger. Heavy motion blur on background foliage. The drone tilts, rolls, and banks sharply to avoid branches, its orange eyes glowing brighter during maneuvers.
8–11s: Tight, dramatic close-ups of the drone as it navigates deeper into darker, mistier sections of the jungle. Sunlight shafts cut through the canopy. The drone’s propellers spin furiously, occasionally clipping leaves and sending small debris flying. Its iridescent body reflects greens and golds from the environment. Camera orbits and pushes in close for mechanical detail.
11–14s: The drone bursts out of the dense jungle into a breathtaking open clearing. It flies straight toward a massive, powerful waterfall cascading dramatically into a turquoise lagoon far below. Thick white mist fills the air, creating a perfect rainbow arching across the scene. The drone hovers briefly in the center of frame, backlit by the waterfall and rainbow, its glowing orange eyes and iridescent shell catching the light dramatically. Final shot slowly pulls back to reveal the full majestic scale of the waterfall and rainbow as the drone holds position.','missing',4,'A sleek insect-like drone dives from above the Amazon canopy into a breakneck chase through the jungle, scattering macaws, before bursting into a clearing to hover before a towering waterfall and rainbow.','keep','pass','aspirational','high','destination-showcase','photoreal','60fps, heavy motion blur','mixed','mixed','none',0.72,'Sci-fi drone skin over real Amazon jungle/waterfall destination; grounded real-world location with cinematic chase craft, no combat/horror, lands as aspirational destination showcase despite fantastical creature design.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
