Dialogue (Female, casual and relaxed tone, speaking Chaoshan dialect): "I didn''t go home for the New Year this year, just me alone in Shenzhen... Hey, this spicy hot pot is really good! My mom called and asked when I''m getting married, I told her I married the spicy hot pot, hahaha." Sound effects: Sound of chopsticks hitting the plastic bowl, slurping sound of noodles, faint sound of firecrackers outside the window, occasional phone notification sounds.
Prohibited: Any text, subtitles, LOGO, or watermark.','missing',6,'Alone in her rented apartment, a young woman settles in for a comforting bowl of spicy hot pot takeout, chatting casually to camera between bites.','keep','pass','direct','standard','light-social','photoreal','low-angle phone stand perspective','warm-amber','24fps-cinematic','none',0.9,'Grounded slice-of-life food vlog, genuine humor about solo New Year, direct food/home subject, authentic casual moment.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
