eyelashes casting shadows. Pearl necklace glows slightly at the collarbone. City lights outside the window blur into bokeh.\n\n[00:06-00:10] Shot 3: Office Breaking Point\n[Japanese Narration]: ''One person is not even allowed to cry.''\nFrontal Medium Shot Slow Dolly In: A cold white fluorescent-lit office, empty after work. Female C leans against the desk, hands clenched at her sides, knuckles white. The camera slowly pushes toward her face — eyes red, tears welling but held back, lips trembling slightly, jaw tight. The tie is pulled loose, shirt collar slightly open.\n\n[00:10-00:13] Shot 4: Triple Cross-Cut (Rapid Cross-Cut)\n[Japanese Narration]: ''Even so—''\nJump Cut alternating three sets of images: \nFemale A suddenly turns and pushes open the nightclub door into the night, fur fluttering in the wind—\nFemale B looks up at the moonlight outside, expression turning from gentle to firm—\nFemale C wipes a tear from the corner of her eye with the back of her hand, takes a deep breath and straightens her back—\nEach image 1 second, rhythm accelerating with low-frequency drum beats.\n\n[00:13-00:15] Shot 5: Final Frame\n[Japanese Narration]: ''They do not stop.''\nTriple Split Screen: Left - Female A walking backlit on the street; Middle - Female B standing by the window in profile; Right - Female C in the elevator looking straight into the lens. All three freeze simultaneously.\nBlack screen, white Japanese handwritten subtitles appear: ''Three nights, three kinds of strength.''','missing',5,'A moody late-night portrait film weaving together three women in different corners of the city — a glamorous club figure, a quiet soul at home, and someone holding back tears at the office — who each find their resolve and refuse to stop.','keep','pass','aspirational','high','mood-piece','photoreal','cinematic color grading; 4K','mixed','mixed','none',0.85,'Grounded real-world urban settings, cinematic emotional character study; no hospitality subject but strong aspirational craft/mood qualifies it; authentic emotional tone, not staged fakery.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
