ed face. Both hands hold a long staff, the staff is dark hardwood with silver metal hoops wrapped around it at intervals, hands gripping the middle and rear sections. First two and a half seconds of suffocating standoff: The white-suited female with gold-copper mechanical arms extends her right arm forward, the tip of the slender sword pointing towards the opponent''s throat, reflecting metal in the backlight. Her left mechanical arm hangs by her side, ready to strike, joint steam slowly seeping out. The robust male in the off-white Hanfu with silver mechanical shoulder armor holds the long staff horizontally in front of him with both hands, his center of gravity sinking into his back foot, his eyes tracking every inch of movement of the opponent''s mechanical arm. The hem of the robe continuously flutters in the wind pressure on the cliff platform, and the shallow water creates dense ripples. The camera slowly pushes in from a low side angle close to the water surface, the waterfall curtain extending to the four edges of the frame. Third second explosion: The white-suited female with gold-copper mechanical arms stomps her right foot, splashing a large area of water. Both arms thrust forward forcefully, lunging with her whole body to stab the slender sword diagonally upwards from a low position, mechanical elbow joint steam jetting out intensely. The robust male with silver mechanical arms in the off-white Hanfu instantly presses the long staff down to diagonally meet the incoming sword. The silver hoops on the staff collide with the sword, creating a loud bang. He uses the force to turn right and backhand sweep the end of the staff towards the opponent''s waist. The two weapons cross in the cold white backlight, and water droplets scatter from the collision point, exploding into a cloud of light points. Three-stage rhythm change: First stage of close-quarters combo: The white-suited female with gold-copper mechanical arms continuously stabs rapidly with the straight sword, changing high and low angles. The hydraulic rods of the mechanical arms are visible extending and retracting with each thrust. The robust male with silver mechanical arms in the off-white Hanfu alternately parries with both ends of the long staff. Micro sparks of fire are generated by joint friction during the high-speed blocking of the silver mechanical arms. Both move quickly in the shallow water, each step splashing a low water curtain. The camera quickly tracks sideways, cutting into a close-up freeze frame of the sparks and water droplets at the moment of weapon collision. Second stage of aerial engagement: The white-suited female with gold-copper mechanical feet steps on the water surface and leaps up, her robe hem and ponytail forming a streamline in the air. At the highest point, she brings the slender sword down with a powerful chop. The robust male with silver mechanical shoulder armor in the off-white Hanfu raises the staff over his head, spreading his arms to meet the attack. The two weapons collide head-on in mid-air, the impact airwave pushing the mist outward into a circle. The camera switches to a top-down view, capturing the cross composition of the two against the white waterfall background. Third stage of close-quarters entanglement: The robust male with silver mechanical arms in the off-white Hanfu uses the long staff to push horizontally against the female''s gold-copper mechanical arm, using the length of the staff to force her towards the edge of the cliff platform. The white-suited female with gold-copper mechanical arms uses her left mechanical arm to hard-block the staff. The torsos of the two are almost touching, and shallow water ripples spread outward between their feet. The camera slightly shakes once with the impact of the weight, simulating a handheld feel. Last three seconds of conclusion: The robust male with silver mechanical shoulder armor in the off-white Hanfu is forced back to the edge of the cliff platform by the final heavy downward chop, kneeling on one knee. The long staff is placed diagonally in front of him, the tail end resting on the slippery ground. The silver mechanical arms tremble slightly, the lower hem of the robe is soaked and clings to his legs, and the waterfall mist falls onto the silver shoulder armor. The white-suited female with gold-copper mechanical arms lands and steps on the water to stabilize her posture, extending the slender sword forward until the tip is less than an inch from the opponent''s neck. The gold-copper mechanical arms are completely still, and the steam slowly dissipates. They look at each other for one second. She slightly withdraws the sword tip by an inch, holding it suspended. The camera slowly pulls back, framing both of them simultaneously. The waterfall curtain rushes across the full frame, and water splashes continue to scatter on the shallow water ground. 8K ultra-high-definition cinematic quality, ultra-realistic texture, 35mm film grain, cold white waterfall background contrasting with the warm color of the gold-copper machinery, silver mechanical parts forming a third layer of luster in the backlight. Fast sideways tracking, close-ups of weapon collisions, top-down emphasis shots, slight handheld shake during heavy impacts. Metal sparks, steam jets, and water splashes are visible throughout. Clothing and hairstyles have realistic physical response to airflow. Continuous action without jump cuts, no anime style, no game interface, no magic light effects, no watermark, no subtitles, no limb deformation.','missing',6,'Two augmented warriors face off on a waterfall cliff platform, trading a tense standoff, a sword-and-staff clash, an airborne collision, and a close grapple, before the duel ends with one fighter yielding at the very tip of the other''s blade.','keep','pass','aspirational','high','craft-piece','stylized-real','35mm film grain','cold-blue','mixed','none',0.72,'Grounded real-world waterfall/cliff setting, cyborg martia