 moment: A car’s headlight suddenly sweeps across the scene, reflecting sharply off the wet floor. The cat skids into a chaotic spiral, claws gripping the slick surface, fur vibrating, droplets flinging outward—captured in 120fps slow motion. Motion instantly resumes at high speed as the cat races along the ramp edge, hugging walls, and threads through a half-open maintenance door or narrow fence gap, escaping into safety. Atmosphere: Claustrophobic, urgent, and tense, yet ultimately triumphant. Sound design emphasizes rushing air, splashing water, metallic echoes from guardrails, and residual vibrations. The sequence concludes as the cat lands in a shadowy corner, with the camera’s lingering tremors gradually fading into stillness.','missing',6,'An unseen house cat streaks through an abandoned parking garage at night, weaving between pillars and puddles in a tense, breathless dash that ends safely in a quiet shadowed corner.','keep','pass','aspirational','standard','craft-piece','photoreal','ultra-wide macro FPV; fisheye distortion; 120fps capture','cold-blue','mixed','none',0.78,'Grounded real-world cat action piece, no hospitality subject but cinematic craft and genuine animal motion qualify as aspirational; authentic, not staged.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence