SCENE BREAKDOWN:

Timing Scene
1 0–2s Establishing wide shot ancient forest transformed, candle-lined aisle, floating flowers, silk-draped trees, golden light
2 2–4s Low angle shot thousands of candles flickering, petals drifting downward like snowfall, crowd seated in reverent silence
3 4–6s Bride appears at far end of aisle silhouetted in ethereal backlight cathedral veil catching floating petals
4 6–8s Smooth cinematic tracking shot alongside bride  candles bowing as she passes flowers parting gently around her
5 8–10s Extreme close up bride''s face glistening eyes, soft lips, single tear on perfectly powdered cheek
6 10–12s Crowd reactions tears, hands over mouths, soft smiles all bathed in warm trembling candlelight
7 12–14s Wide overhead drone shot full breathtaking aisle of light and floating blooms bride a single luminous figure 
8 14–15s Final frame bride reaches the end of the aisle candles flare softly petals cascade all around her','missing',8,'In an ancient forest transformed into a candlelit cathedral of floating flowers, a bride walks slowly down a glowing aisle as the gathered crowd looks on in tearful silence.','keep','pass','aspirational','high','cultural-moment','photoreal','','warm-amber','mixed','none',0.87,'Grounded, brand-safe, dreamlike wedding/venue moment with impossible floating-flower magical realism but no fantasy world-break; strong cinematic wedding/venue aspirational piece, genuine emotional register not performed-for-camera falseness.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
