# Style
Movie-quality culinary footage. Warm white indirect lighting + rim lighting from steam. Anamorphic lens flare, shallow depth of field, 35mm film-like grain. Teal & orange color grading.

# Setting
Bright home kitchen. White tiles, wooden cutting board, silver frying pan. Daylight natural light.

# Scenes
A series of steps for vigorously making Peperoncino, cut at a brisk tempo.

cut1:
Extreme close-up. The knife slices garlic all at once. Ambient sound: Rhythmical knife sounds.

Lens switch

cut2:
Macro overhead view. A still shot of sliced garlic spreading on the cutting board. Ambient sound: Silence.

Lens switch

cut3:
Low angle. Olive oil is poured and spreads in the frying pan, glowing in the backlight. Ambient sound: Smooth liquid sounds.

Lens switch

cut4:
Extreme close-up. The moment garlic and chili peppers are tossed into the oil. Ambient sound: Sizzling sound.

Lens switch

cut5:
Side macro. Bubbles rise on the oil''s surface as the garlic turns golden brown. Ambient sound: Sizzling, bubbling oil sounds.

Lens switch

cut6:
Overhead view. Pasta swims in a vortex of boiling water in a large pot. Steam rises upwards. Ambient sound: Bubbling boiling sounds.

Lens switch

cut7:
Low angle, right at the edge. Pasta is tossed into the frying pan, and steam rises explosively. Ambient sound: Bursting steam sounds.

Lens switch

cut8:
Medium close-up from a diagonal front angle. Vigorously tossing the frying pan. The pasta leaps high into the air. Ambient sound: The sound of pasta cutting through the air, metallic sounds.

Lens switch

cut9:
Bust shot. Vigorously plating the pasta onto a white dish with tongs. Ambient sound: The sound of the plate and tongs touching.

Lens switch

cut10:
Overhead, straight from above. Parsley falls from fingertips and lands on the finished dish. Stay still for a few seconds with the camera fixed. Ambient sound: Complete silence.','missing',10,'In a bright home kitchen, a cook races through the sharp, precise steps of making peperoncino pasta, from slicing garlic to a dramatic pan toss, ending with parsley falling onto the finished plate.','keep','pass','direct','high','food-cm','2.5d-hybrid','movie-quality culinary footage, anamorphic lens flare, shallow depth of field, 35mm film-like grain','teal-orange','high-fps-slowmo','none',0.95,'Grounded anime-style culinary craft piece, food is the direct subject, genre-honest cooking-ad energy, no authenticity issues.',false) on conflict (clip_id) do update set video_id=excluded.video_id, title=excluded.title, generator=excluded.generator, runtime_s=excluded.runtime_s, aspect_ratio=excluded.aspect_ratio, source_url=excluded.source_url, verbatim_prompt=excluded.verbatim_prompt, asset_status=excluded.asset_status, shot_count=excluded.shot_count, summary=excluded.summary, verdict=excluded.verdict, step1_grounded_brand_safe=excluded.step1_grounded_brand_safe, home_route=excluded.home_route, distinctiveness=excluded.distinctiveness, register=excluded.register, realism_level=excluded.realism_level, render_stack=excluded.render_stack, grade=excluded.grade, motion_feel=excluded.motion_feel, ip_flags=excluded.ip_flags, gate_confidence=excluded.gate_confidence, gate_notes=excluded.gate_notes, is_demo_seed=excluded.is_demo_seed;
